cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FRAM Data Pipeline
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.2.2
date-released: "2026-10-29"
abstract: >
  Software for processing and archiving observation data from the FRAM robotic
  telescopes (Photometric Robotic Atmospheric Monitor). The pipeline extracts
  and validates metadata from FITS files, enriches it with image-derived
  quantities (FWHM, sky position, image statistics), generates InvenioRDM-compatible
  JSON records for bulk import, and publishes records to the Physica
  repository. Also includes safe recursive FITS tile-compression using fpack.
authors:
  - name: "FZU Institute of Physics of the Czech Academy of Sciences"
keywords:
  - FRAM
  - astronomy
  - astrophysics
  - FITS
  - data pipeline
  - robotic telescope
  - atmospheric monitoring
  - photometric monitoring
  - FAIR data
  - InvenioRDM
  - CTA
  - Auger
